GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "F57490F018FDBDC9"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{5693F231C92483CA}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "Radical environmentalist from the Earth Contamination Outfit have launched a surprise attack on a TEM POWER oil rig off the coast of Scotland."\
     "They've captured hostages and plan to blow the rig sky high with the goal of causing an environmental distaster."\
     ""\
     "Can 42Cmdo rapidly deploy and neutralize the threat in time?"\
     "__________________________________"\
     "• RATIO: 2.7:1:0.4 - UK:ECO:CIV"\
     "• JIP: Blufor - Yes | Opfor - Deny after 5mins."\
     "• Timelimit: 35mins."\
     "• There is no single commander for ECO. It's competely decentralised."\
     ""\
     "- THIS MISSION HAS NOT BEEN DESIGNED FOR ADDITONAL SLOTS TO BE ADDED"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7E59DC1AF77E2BB9}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2> "\
     "Date: 1st May 2020"\
     "Time: Random"\
     "Location: Mull of Kintyre, Scotland"\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2> "\
     "Radical environmentalists from the Earth Contamination Outfit (ECO) have launched a surprise attack on a TEM POWER oil rig off the coast of Scotland."\
     ""\
     "British intelligence has been monitoring the group for several years as their activities and influence have grown within the UK. Despite this surveillance, the planning and preparation for this operation — including the movement of weapons and equipment — managed to evade detection."\
     ""\
     "The ECO has carried out smaller-scale actions across the country before, but nothing approaching the scale of this attack."\
     "Earlier today, the militants arrived by boat and boarded the platform via the access stairs, quickly overpowering rig personnel and seizing control of the installation. A number of crew members were able to escape using lifeboats, but several were captured during the takeover."\
     "Current reports indicate that five workers are being held hostage somewhere on the platform."\
     ""\
     "Royal Marines have been tasked with conducting an assault on the rig, eliminating the hostile elements, and securing the hostages. The situation is volatile, and the militants may attempt to use the hostages as leverage once contact is made."\
     ""\
     "Time is critical. The rig must be retaken and the remaining crew recovered."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B4923C4BD3286905}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Our oil rig has been attacked by the radical environmentalist group known as the Earth Contamination Outfit (ECO)"\
     "We've tried to flee but were captured and are now at the mercy of the ECO."\
     ""\
     "We should do as they tell us and hope rescue comes soon."\
     "They claim they're here to blow the whole rig sky high with a huge bomb which they've brought aboard."\
     ""\
     "We can attempt to flee if we really wish, and aid our rescue team by means of directions, intel, and such (No guns, grenades, etc), but expect the ECO group to most likely punish us, if even kill some of us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5D5FD5F512815256}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2> "\
     "Date: 1st May 2020"\
     "Time: Random"\
     "Location: Mull of Kintyre, Scotland"\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2> "\
     "Radical environmentalists from the Earth Contamination Outfit (ECO) have launched a surprise attack on a TEM POWER oil rig off the coast of Scotland."\
     ""\
     "British intelligence has been monitoring our movement for several years as our organization has grown more prominent across the UK. Despite this scrutiny, the planning and preparation for this operation — including the movement of weapons and equipment — managed to slip past their surveillance."\
     "Our group has conducted smaller operations throughout the country before, but nothing on this scale."\
     ""\
     "Arriving by boat, we ascended the access stairs and seized the rig by force. A number of crew members managed to escape using the lifeboats, but several were captured during the takeover."\
     "Five workers are now being held hostage. They will serve as leverage when the inevitable assault comes."\
     ""\
     "Today may be our final stand, but change will follow in our wake."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "ECO"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8D0AAD38E8C840CA}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces are the Earth Contamination Outfit. "\
     "A known terrorist group that have been conducting attacks through the UK."\
     "Reports from the crew members who managed to flee say the enemy troops number around 10x people."\
     ""\
     "They're located at the TEM POWER oil rig at GRID: 048017"\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "Crew members said they saw various wepons, machine gun both small and big, rifles, shotguns, some that looked modern, some that looked old."\
     "The enemy outfit wore a camo red patterned unifom with yet again various hats, helmets, vests, and backpacks of different colours and patterns."\
     ""\
     "Observations show no armed vessels."\
     "We don't know what equipment they have. Be cautious of booby traps and alike."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5E164F526CACAA34}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Our enemy is anyone who stands against real change on this earth."\
     "For far too long, nations have failed to act while the rich grow richer and the poor grow poorer. Now they will be forced to respond."\
     "In this moment, our immediate enemy will be the British state."\
     ""\
     "We can expect a rapid reaction to our presence, as our actions have already made it clear that this rig is under our control. The closest military unit is 42 Commando, stationed at the airfield north of our position, and they are the most likely force to respond."\
     "The scale and method of their assault are currently unknown."\
     ""\
     "Their staging location is the airfield at GRID: 048117."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "Unknown."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "ECO"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5C9B6BEFF2079933}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are the British 42 Commando raiding troop."\
     "Total strength is 32 personnel, including pilots and aircrew, giving us 29 ground troops."\
     "Our current location is the airfield at GRID: 048117."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "We have several methods of insertion onto the rig:"\
     ""\
     "• A: Utilize the helicopters at our current location to fly directly to the rig and land on the platform."\
     "• B: Teleport via the flagpole to one of three docks located at GRID 058035, GRID 027018, and GRID 077006."\
     "Each dock has RHIB fast raiding boats which can be used to approach the access stairs located on the legs of the rig."\
     "• C: Deploy via steerable parachutes. Interact with the flagpole to teleport to a platform 1500m above the rig. Parachutes are available at the platform."\
     "• D: A combination of any of the above methods."\
     ""\
     "• Mavic drone operator for reconnaissance"\
     "• Sappers are equipped with small demolition charges and wire cutters should the situation require their use."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE AND SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• Two GPMG-armed UH-1H helicopters are available at the staging location - 16 spare seats for troops."\
     "• Each dock contains 3x .50cal RHIBs, capable of carrying 9 personnel."\
     "Note that the elevation on the mounted guns may not be sufficient to engage targets on the upper levels of the rig once in close proximity."\
     "• A supply crate at spawn contains our Mavic drones + batteries, extendable ladders, and handheld periscopes"\
     "- There are drone antennas at each TP location to extend the range."\
     ""\
     "<h2>PARACHUTE MANUAL</h2>"\
     "1. Equip the parachute and jump bag."\
     "2. Transfer your equipment into the jump bag. The transfer time will increase depending on how much equipment you are carrying."\
     "3. Press the space bar once while falling to deploy the parachute. There is no freefall control; you will descend in a straight line until the parachute is deployed."\
     "4. Once deployed, use the WASD keys to control the parachute. Parachutes deploy almost instantly, allowing for very low-altitude deployment. Descent speed is affected by wind conditions."\
     "5. <b>SLOW DOWN</b> before hitting the ground."\
     "6. Drop your parachute once you have landed."\
     "• You can press <b>X</b> to cut away your parachute. There is no reserve chute."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{BCCC09AE4B604DAF}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are the Earth Contamination Outfit (ECO), a collection of radical environmentalists who believe real change will only come through direct action. Our goal is to force the world to confront ecological collapse by creating disasters that affect everyone — rich and poor alike — until nations abandon fossil fuels and transition to renewable energy."\
     ""\
     "Our ECO cell consists of 11 personnel."\
     "Our current location is the TEM POWER oil rig at GRID: 048017."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "We are limited in modern weaponry and equipment, but what we lack in technology we make up for with conviction, determination, and belief in our cause. Death before surrender."\
     ""\
     "Our arsenal consists of a mix of modern, Cold War, and even WWII-era weapons, including rifles, machine guns, submachine guns, shotguns, and bolt-action rifles from both Western and Eastern origins."\
     ""\
     "Personnel are equipped with high explosive and smoke grenades. Most fighters carry at least one of each, with some carrying additional grenades."\
     "Our machine gunners carry heavier equipment and protective gear, making them slower but better protected."\
     ""\
     "All personnel are equipped with radios."\
     "We also possess zip-cuffs for restraining the captured hostages."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "ECO"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4A1ADF03319A0C0C}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Our mission is to conduct a <b>DELIBERATE RAID</b> on the TEM POWER oil rig in order to <b>DESTROY</b> the hostile forces onboard, <b>SECURE</b> any hostages, and <b>DEFUSE</b> a bomb which ECO militants claim will detonate in approximately 35 minutes."\
     ""\
     "<h2>OBJECTIVES</h2>"\
     "This is a complex and confined environment. Careful selection of entry points, coordinated timing, and clear communication will be critical to mission success."\
     ""\
     "<b>PRIMARY:</b> Locate, secure, and defuse the bomb planted on the rig."\
     ""\
     "Crew members who escaped reported seeing a large bomb-like device being carried into the central compound on the ground floor, located at the base of the main tower."\
     ""\
     "CCTV has since confirmed the presence of an object matching the witness descriptions."\
     "Our sappers have assessed the device by observation and estimate that it will take approximately three minutes to defuse. If we can secure and hold the fenced compound containing the bomb for this duration, we have a strong chance of successfully defusing it."\
     ""\
     "<b>SECONDARY:</b> Neutralize the hostile ECO presence on the rig by any necessary means."\
     ""\
     "<b>OPTIONAL:</b> Locate and recover the missing crew members believed to be held hostage somewhere on the platform."\
     ""\
     "While the hostages are important, preventing the destruction of the rig and eliminating the wider threat remain our primary concerns."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B376662B52212662}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Our mission is to DEFEND the oil rig for the next 35 minutes while the bomb counts down to detonation."\
     ""\
     "<h2>EXECUTION</h2>"\
     "<b>BOMB:</b>  "\
     "The bomb is currently armed and positioned on a pallet truck within the drilling compound, located on the ground floor at the center of the rig, at the base of the large tower."\
     ""\
     "If enemy forces manage to secure and hold this compound for too long, they will likely be able to defuse the device. This area must remain secured at all times."\
     ""\
     "<b>ENEMY TROOPS:</b>  "\
     "Our primary objective is not the destruction of enemy forces, but the defense of the bomb itself."\
     ""\
     "If the bomb is successfully defused, our focus should shift to eliminating enemy forces where possible in order to create an opportunity to withdraw and continue our operations elsewhere in the future."\
     ""\
     "<b>HOSTAGES:</b>  "\
     "Hostages may be positioned where we see fit, provided they are not used to physically block access points or exploited in unrealistic ways to gain cover or other unfair advantages."\
     ""\
     "That said, hostages may be used as a deterrent to discourage enemy fire directed at ourselves or the bomb area."\
     ""\
     "Hostages are only strategically useful while the bomb remains active, as they can delay or complicate enemy action. If the bomb is defused, they no longer serve a strategic purpose and may be dealt with at our discretion."\
     ""\
     "<b>(Hostage players have been instructed to generally comply with OPFOR orders. However, they may choose to attempt escape or disobey instructions at their own discretion, at which point their fate is in the hands of OPFOR.)</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "ECO"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{50C9D6A9EC1C2772}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
     "• <b>TRP HQ</b> - 11"\
     "• <b>TRP OC</b> - 11A"\
     "• <b>TRP SGT</b> - 11B"\
     "• <b>1SEC</b> - 11C"\
     "• <b>2SEC</b> - 11D"\
     "• <b>3SEC</b>- 11E"\
     "• <b>4SEC</b> - 11F"\
     ""\
     "<h2>RADIO FREQS</h2>"\
     "• <b>Troop net</b> - 40hz | <b>Air net</b> - 40.5hz "\
     "• <b>HQ</b> - 39.5hz"\
     "• <b>1st SEC</b> - 39hz"\
     "• <b>2nd SEC</b> - 38.5hz"\
     "• <b>3rd SEC</b> - 38hz"\
     "• <b>4th SEC</b> - 37.5hz"\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISC</h2>"\
     " <b>Challenge:</b> Silver | <b>Password:</b> Birch"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F402F3A3CF22D03C}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>RADIO FREQ</h2>"\
     "• All callsigns: 38hz"\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISC</h2>"\
     "• <b>Challanege:</b> Mince | <b>Password:</b> Pie"\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "ECO"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0304F1F5444246F5}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "Mission notes"
     m_sContent "THIS MISSION HAS NOT BEEN DESIGNED FOR ADDITIONAL SLOTS TO BE ADDED"\
     ""\
     "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
     "<b>UK:</b>  "\
     "• <b>Major Victory</b> – Defuse the bomb, eliminate 90% of ECO forces, and rescue ALL player hostages. (AI/open slots will be deleted)"\
     "• <b>Minor Victory</b> – Defuse the bomb, eliminate 90% of ECO forces, but player hostages died."\
     "• <b>Pyrrhic Victory</b> – The bomb is defused, but at least 87% of UK forces are killed in the process of clearing ECO team."\
     "• <b>Failure</b> – The bomb remains armed and 87% of UK forces are killed."\
     ""\
     "<b>ECO:</b>  "\
     "• <b>Major Victory</b> – Successfully defend the bomb for 35 minutes, allowing it to detonate and destroy the rig, killing everyone onboard.  "\
     "<b>OR</b>  "\
     "Eliminate 87% of UK ground troops, allowing the bomb to detonate uncontested.  "\
     "• <b>Minor Victory</b> – The bomb is defused, but ECO successfully kills 87% of UK forces, allowing ECO to escape and potentially strike again."\
     "• <b>Failure</b> – ECO sustains 90% casualties."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISC</h2>"\
     "• RATIO: 2.7 : 1 : 0.4 — UK : ECO : CIV  "\
     "• Time limit: 35 minutes  "\
     "• JIP: BLUFOR – Yes | OPFOR – Denied after 5 minutes  "\
     "• AO Limit: Yes – ECO team"\
     ""\
     "<h2>HOSTAGE GAMEPLAY</h2>"\
     "• Hostages cannot be placed in access routes to buildings or key areas.  "\
     "• Hostages cannot be used in exploitative ways, such as being climbed on or positioned to create blatantly unfair gameplay advantages.  "\
     "• Hostages may not be executed by the ECO team UNLESS..(see below)"\
     ""\
     "<b>EXCEPTIONS:</b>  "\
     "• If the bomb is defused, hostages are no longer considered strategically valuable. ECO may then decide how to deal with them.  "\
     "• If a hostage is actively or repeatedly disobeying orders, attempting to escape, attempting deception, or assisting the UK team, ECO may administer punishment, including execution."\
     ""\
     "<h2>PERFORMANCE</h2>"\
     "Performance on this rig is generally higher than typical Arma 3 environments. However, during nighttime conditions, lighting may reduce FPS due to multiple dynamic shadows cast by lamps and floodlights around the structure. This effect is amplified during heavy rain."\
     ""\
     "This is most noticeable near the center of the rig where the large floodlights illuminate the tower, gangways, and chain-lined fences, creating complex shadow interactions."\
     ""\
     "If performance becomes an issue, consider lowering shadow or lighting quality in your graphics settings to improve FPS."\
     "(In testing at maximum graphics settings, performance remained above 45 FPS in the central area at night.)"\
     ""\
     "If performance becomes unplayable, a Game Master may adjust the time of day or weather conditions to something similar but less demanding. Use discretion when making such changes."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
